# Optional deployment configuration.

# Canonical site URL used for sitemap.xml, robots.txt, canonical links, and
# JSON-LD structured data. If unset, the code falls back to
# https://nabindhungana.com.
#
# Set it per hosting platform when the domain differs (e.g. a preview/staging
# URL or a custom domain configured after publish).
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://nabindhungana.com

# No secrets live in this repository. The site has no backend, database, or
# authentication — keep it that way. Any future service keys (e.g. email relay
# or a headless CMS) belong in NON-public variables at the hosting platform.